## How to Run

# Commands

## 1. Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/<your-username>/EEN1095Project-Repository.git
cd EEN1095Project-Repository
```

---

## 2. Install Required Packages

```bash
pip install torch numpy pandas matplotlib gymnasium stable-baselines3
```

---

## 4. Train D3QN

```bash
python -m src.train_d3q
```

---

## 5. Evaluate D3QN

```bash
python -m src.evaluate_d3q
```

---

## 6. Train PPO

```bash
python -m src.train_ppo
```

---

## 7. Evaluate PPO

```bash
python -m src.evaluate_ppo
```

---

## 8. Generate Comparison Graphs

```bash
python -m src.plot_comparison_graphs
```

---

## 9. Repository Structure

```text
src/        → Source code
models/     → Trained D3QN and PPO models
results/    → Evaluation results (CSV files)
figures/    → Performance comparison graphs
plots/      → Training plots
archive/    → Previous implementation
```

---

## Review Instructions

The final implementation is located in the **`src/`** directory.

To review the project:

1. Review the source code in `src/`.
2. Trained models are available in `models/`.
3. Evaluation results are available in `results/`.
4. Performance graphs are available in `figures/`.

To reproduce the results:

```bash
python -m src.evaluate_d3q
python -m src.evaluate_ppo
python -m src.plot_comparison_graphs
```
